            <ArticleTitle>Shape Controlled Hierarchical Porous Hydrophobic/Oleophilic Metal-Organic Nanofibrous Gel Composites for Oil Adsorption.</ArticleTitle>
            <ELocationID EIdType="doi" ValidYN="Y">10.1002/adma.201605307</ELocationID>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>A versatile and facile synthetic route toward a ultralight hierarchical poroushybrid composed of metal-organic gels and fluorinated graphene oxide is reported. The composite gels show excellent absorbency of oil and various organic solvents due to their prominent meso/macropores, notable hydrophobicity, and superoleophilicity.</AbstractText>
